  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5910.02 Authorization Statement of Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5910.02 Authorization Statement of Certification. By signing the “Authority to Establish Courses” form, the EMS I/C shall certify that:\n\n(a) The course shall be taught in an interactive learning environment; and\n\n(b) The course shall be taught in accordance with the training curriculum standards for which authorization is granted by the division.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
